# Vulnerabilities in the Airflow image that I have looked at and accepted for now.
# Each entry expires, so the scan fails again on the expiry date and I have to look again.
# Reviewed on 2026-10-10.

# netty-handler 4.1.96, bundled in PySpark 3.5.9. The flaw is in how a Netty server routes
# TLS connections by server name. Spark runs here in local mode, with no TLS server and no
# open port, and the box accepts no inbound traffic. No PySpark release ships a fixed Netty.
CVE-2026-75595 exp:2027-01-08

# avro 1.7.7, shaded inside hadoop-client-runtime 3.3.4, bundled in PySpark 3.5.9. The flaw
# needs a program to parse an untrusted Avro schema. My pipelines read no Avro files, and the
# copy in Hadoop is not called. PySpark's own avro jar is already the fixed 1.11.5.
CVE-2024-47561 exp:2027-01-08
